--- !u!114 &160496539546330666
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 35275184676936928}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u25CF<indent=10>A reactor coolant pump is a\_type of centrifugal pump,
    which circulates the coolant necessary to carry away the decay heat.</indent>\n\u25CF<indent=10>Reactor
    coolant pumps (RCPs) circulate the reactor coolant to remove and transfer the
    amount of heat generated in the reactor core.</indent>\n\u25CF<indent=10>The
    coolant enters the suction nozzle of the pump at high pressure and temperature.
    The coolant is rotated at high speed by the pump impeller.</indent>\n\u25CF<indent=10>The
    high-velocity coolant is converted to pressure in the discharge nozzle.</indent>\n\u25CF<indent=10>After
    the coolant leaves the discharge side of the pump, it enters the pipe, which
    provides cooling to the reactor core.</indent>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e63ac0177aeed334f9a24408402d8fb6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1749380657243123591, guid: e63ac0177aeed334f9a24408402d8fb6,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
